        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Nutrition - Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Macronutrient | Energy density | Primary pathway |\n|---------------|---------------|-----------------|\n| Carbohydrate | 4 kcal/g | Glycolysis → pyruvate → acetyl-CoA → TCA → OXPHOS |\n| Protein | 4 kcal/g | Transamination + deamination → gluconeogenesis or TCA |\n| Fat | 9 kcal/g | β-oxidation → acetyl-CoA → TCA → OXPHOS |\n| Alcohol | 7 kcal/g | ADH → acetaldehyde → ALDH → acetate → acetyl-CoA |\n| Fiber | ~2 kcal/g | Gut bacteria → short-chain fatty acids (butyrate, propionate, acetate) |"
    },
