        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. Randomized Controlled Trials (RCTs)\n   └── Gold standard, BUT hard in nutrition:\n       ✗ Years-long interventions needed for chronic disease endpoints\n       ✗ Cannot blind food allocation (participants know what they eat)\n       ✗ Compliance degrades over years; free-living subjects cheat\n       ✗ Surrogate endpoints (LDL, CRP) ≠ clinical outcomes (MI, death)\n       ✗ Individual variation enormous (same diet, very different responses)"
    },
