      },
      "text": "3. Prospective cohort studies (e.g., Nurses' Health Study, EPIC)\n   └── Large N, long follow-up, BUT:\n       ✗ Dietary recall via FFQ (food frequency questionnaire) is poor proxy\n       ✗ Healthy user bias: vegetable eaters also exercise, sleep, don't smoke\n       ✗ Residual confounding: can never measure everything\n       ✗ Relative risks in cohort nutrition studies are typically small (HR 1.1–1.3)\n          → easily explained by confounding"
    },
